Predict only at the first token of each model-visible document. Initial
Latin capitals, title-case words, and Markdown headings get a positive
pulse. Leading whitespace and most other tokens do not. The two common
openers 'The' and 'This' have especially strong pulses. Length and case
provide coarse estimates rather than an arbitrary vocabulary lookup.
