"""Ability and permission words, plus Chinese linking words and pronouns.

The component fires on words meaning "can" (strongest: 可以, then 能够/不能/无法/只能, and
English "can" / "cannot"), more weakly on necessity and possibility words (需要, 应该, 必须,
可能, 要), and weakly on Chinese connectives, pronouns and function words (但是, 而且, 所以,
已经, 我们, 在, 是). Other tokens are near zero, and English "should" / "could" slightly negative.

The program looks only at the current token. For multi-character Chinese tokens it matches
by containment, so 就可以 and 我们可以 count as 可以.
"""

READS = ()

