speak family and homophone peek trigger smaller ones. Chinese peak/edge
characters, plus several characters pronounced feng, also respond. Two
input/output header names are separate triggers. 'Of' after peak(s) continues
the response. Lowercase 'speaker' is strongest near a document's beginning;
its extra strength decays with document position. Other tokens get zero.
